hadiths[33]{hadithnumber,text}:
"254","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Munkadir se, unhon ne Saeed bin Jubair se, unhon ne aik shakhs se jis par wo raazi they riwayat kya ke unhein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha ne khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke koi shakhs nahi jis ki raat ki Namaz ho aur use neend ghalib aa jaye magar Allah us ke liye us ki Namaz ka ajr likhta hai aur us ki neend us par sadqa hoti hai."
"255","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Umar bin Ubaidullah ke ghulam Abul Nazar se, unhon ne Abu Salma bin Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samne soti thi aur mere paon Aap ke qibla mein hote, phir jab Aap sajda karte to mujhe chhute to main apne paon samet leti, phir jab Aap khade hote to unhein phela deti. Unhon ne kaha ke ghar us din chiraghon se khaali they."
"256","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se kisi ko apni Namaz mein oongh aae to use let jana chahiye yahan tak ke neend us se chali jaye, kyunke jab tum mein se koi oonghte hue Namaz padhta hai to use maloom nahi, shayad wo istighfar karne jaye aur apne aap ko bura kahe."
"257","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ismail bin Abi Hakeem se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne raat mein aik aurat ko Namaz padhte suna aur farmaya ke ye kaun hai. To Aap se kaha gaya ke ye Haula bint Tuwait hain jo raat ko nahi soti. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is ko napasand kya yahan tak ke napasandgi Aap ke chehre mein pehchani gai, phir farmaya ke Allah Tabarak wa Taala nahi uktata yahan tak ke tum ukta jao, amal mein se utna apne zimme lo jitni tum mein taqat hai."
"258","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab raat mein jitna Allah chahta Namaz padhte, phir jab raat ka aakhir hota to apne ghar walon ko Namaz ke liye jagate aur un se kehte ke Namaz, Namaz, phir ye aayat tilawat karte ke apne ghar walon ko Namaz ka hukm do aur is par sabr karo, hum tum se rizq nahi mangte, hum tumhein rizq dete hain aur anjaam taqwa ke liye hai."
"259","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Saeed bin Musayyab kehte they ke Isha se pehle sona aur is ke baad baat karna makrooh samjha jata hai."
"260","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke raat aur din ki Namaz do do rakat hai, har do rakaton se salam pherta hai."
"261","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Urwa bin Zubair se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat mein gyarah rakat Namaz padhte they, un mein se aik se witr karte, phir jab farigh hote to daain pehlu par let jate."
"262","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Saeed bin Abi Saeed Maqbari se, unhon ne Abu Salma bin Abdur Rahman bin Auf se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se sawal kya ke Ramzan mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Namaz kaisi hoti thi, to unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ramzan mein aur na is ke siwa mein gyarah rakat se zyada na karte, chaar padhte to un ke husn aur tool ke bare mein na poochho, phir chaar padhte to un ke husn aur tool ke bare mein na poochho, phir teen padhte. Aaisha ne kaha ke maine kaha ke ya Rasulullah kya Aap witr se pehle sote hain, to Aap ne farmaya ke aey Aaisha meri aankhein soti hain aur mera dil nahi sota."
"263","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Ummul Momineen Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat mein terah rakat Namaz padhte they phir jab Fajr ki azaan sunte to do halki rakat Namaz padhte."
"264","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Makhrama bin Sulaiman se, unhon ne Ibn Abbas ke ghulam Kuraib se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Abbas ne unhein khabar di ke wo aik raat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Maimuna ke paas rahe jo un ki khaala thin. Unhon ne kaha ke main takiye ki chaudai mein leta aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap ke ghar wale us ki lambai mein lete, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) soe yahan tak ke jab aadhi raat hui ya is se thoda pehle ya is se thoda baad, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bedaar hue aur baith kar apne haath se neend ko chehre se ponchhne lage, phir Surah Aal-e-Imran ki aakhri dus aayatein padhin, phir latki hui mashk ki taraf khade hue aur us se wuzu kya aur achchha wuzu kya, phir Namaz padhne khade hue. Ibn Abbas ne kaha ke main khada hua aur waisa hi kya jaisa unhon ne kya, phir gaya aur un ke pehlu mein khada hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna daayan haath mere sar par rakha aur mera daayan kaan pakad kar marodne lage, phir do rakat Namaz padhi phir do rakat phir do rakat phir do rakat phir do rakat phir do rakat, phir witr padha phir lete rahe yahan tak ke moazzin un ke paas aaya to do halki rakat Namaz padhi phir nikle aur Fajr ki Namaz padhi."
"265","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Qais bin Makhrama ne unhein Zaid bin Khalid Juhani se khabar di ke unhon ne kaha ke main aaj raat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Namaz ko dekhunga. Unhon ne kaha ke maine un ki dehleez ya kheme ko takiya banaya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khade hue aur do lambi lambi lambi rakat Namaz padhi, phir do rakat padhi jo un dono se kam thin jo un se pehle thin, phir do rakat padhi jo un dono se kam thin jo un se pehle thin, phir do rakat padhi jo un dono se kam thin jo un se pehle thin, phir do rakat padhi jo un dono se kam thin jo un se pehle thin, phir do rakat padhi jo un dono se kam thin jo un se pehle thin, phir witr padha, to ye terah rakat thin."
"266","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se aur Abdullah bin Dinar se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke aik shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se raat ki Namaz ke bare mein sawal kya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke raat ki Namaz do do rakat hai, phir jab tum mein se koi Fajr se dare to aik rakat padhe jo us ne padhi hai use witr bana de."
"267","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Yahya bin Hibban se, unhon ne Ibn Muhairiz se riwayat kya ke Banu Kinana mein se aik shakhs jise Mukhdaji kaha jata hai ne Sham mein aik shakhs se suna jise Abu Muhammad kaha jata hai, kehta tha ke witr wajib hai. To Mukhdaji ne kaha ke main Ubada bin Samit ke paas gaya aur jab wo masjid ki taraf ja rahe they un ke samne aaya aur unhein wo bataya jo Abu Muhammad ne kaha tha to Ubada ne kaha ke Abu Muhammad ne jhoot kaha, maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmate suna ke paanch Namazein hain jinhein Allah Azza wa Jal ne bandon par likha hai, phir jo unhein le aae aur un mein se koi cheez un ke haq ko halka samajhte hue zaya na kare us ke liye Allah ke paas ehad hai ke use Jannat mein dakhil kare, aur jo unhein na laae us ke liye Allah ke paas ehad nahi, agar chahe use azaab de aur agar chahe use Jannat mein dakhil kare."
"268","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Bakr bin Umar se, unhon ne Saeed bin Yasar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Makka ke raste mein Abdullah bin Umar ke sath chal raha tha. Saeed ne kaha ke jab mujhe Fajr ka khauf hua to main utra aur witr padha phir unhein pa liya to Abdullah bin Umar ne mujh se kaha ke tum kahan they, maine un se kaha ke mujhe Fajr ka khauf hua to main utra aur witr padha. To Abdullah ne kaha ke kya tumhare liye Rasulullah mein namoona nahi hai. Maine kaha ke kyun nahi, Allah ki qasam. Unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) oont par witr padhte they."
"269","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Abu Bakr Siddiq jab apne bistar par aana chahte to witr padhte aur Umar bin Khattab raat ke aakhir mein witr padhte they. Saeed bin Musayyab ne kaha ke raha main to jab apne bistar par aata hun to witr padhta hun."
"270","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke aik shakhs ne Abdullah bin Umar se witr ke bare mein sawal kya ke kya ye wajib hai, to Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne witr padha aur musalmanon ne witr padha. Wo shakhs un par dobara sawal karta raha aur Abdullah bin Umar kehte ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne witr padha aur musalmanon ne witr padha."
"271","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha kehti thin ke jo dare ke subah tak soya rahe use sone se pehle witr padhna chahiye, aur jo umeed rakhe ke raat ke aakhir mein bedaar hoga use apne witr mein takheer karni chahiye."
"272","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Makka mein Abdullah bin Umar ke sath tha aur aasman badalon wala tha to Abdullah ko Fajr ka khauf hua aur aik se witr padha, phir badal chhat gae aur unhon ne dekha ke un par raat hai to aik se shafa kya, phir is ke baad do do rakat Namaz padhi, phir jab Fajr ka khauf hua to aik se witr padha."
"273","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar witr mein do rakaton aur aik rakat ke darmiyan salam pherte they yahan tak ke apni kisi haajat ka hukm dete."
"274","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke Saad bin Abi Waqqas Isha ke baad aik se witr padhte they. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek amal is par nahi hai lekin witr ka kam az kam teen hai."
"275","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Dinar se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke Maghrib ki Namaz din ki Namazon ka witr hai. Malik ne kaha ke jo raat ke awal mein witr padhe phir soe phir khada ho aur use Namaz padhna aae to do do rakat padhe, ye mere nazdeek jo maine suna hai us mein sab se pasandida hai."
"276","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Basra ke Abdul Karim bin Abil Mukhariq se, unhon ne Saeed bin Jubair se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Abbas soe phir bedaar hue aur apne khadim se kaha ke dekho logon ne kya kya. Aur wo us din apni basarat kho chuke they. To khadim gaya phir lauta aur kaha ke log Fajr se farigh ho chuke hain. To Abdullah bin Abbas khade hue aur witr padha phir Fajr ki Namaz padhi."
"277","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Abdullah bin Abbas aur Ubada bin Samit aur Qasim bin Muhammad aur Abdullah bin Amir bin Rabia ne Fajr ke baad witr padha."
"278","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Masud ne kaha ke mujhe parwa nahi agar Fajr ki Namaz khadi ki jaye jab ke main witr padh raha hun."
"279","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Ubada bin Samit qoum ki imamat karte they aur aik din Fajr ki taraf nikle to moazzin ne Fajr ki Namaz ke liye iqamat kahi to Ubada ne use khamosh kya yahan tak ke witr padha phir unhein Fajr ki Namaz padhai."
"280","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Abdullah bin Amir bin Rabia ko kehte suna ke main witr padhta hun jab ke iqamat sunta hun, ya Fajr ke baad. Abdur Rahman ko shak hai ke un dono mein se kaunsi kahi."
"281","Mujhe Malik ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se riwayat kya ke unhon ne apne walid Qasim bin Muhammad ko kehte suna ke main Fajr ke baad witr padhta hun. Malik ne kaha ke Fajr ke baad sirf wo witr padhta hai jo witr se soya raha ho, aur kisi ke liye jaiz nahi ke is ka irada kare yahan tak ke apne witr ko Fajr ke baad rakhe."
"282","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Hafsa ne unhein khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab moazzin Fajr ki Namaz ki azaan se khamosh hote to Namaz khadi hone se pehle do halki rakat padhte they."
"283","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Fajr ki do rakaton ko halka karte they yahan tak ke main kehti ke kya unhon ne Surah Fatiha padhi ya nahi."
"284","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shareek bin Abdullah bin Abi Namr se, unhon ne Abu Salma bin Abdur Rahman se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke kuchh qoum ne iqamat suni to khade hue Namaz padhne lage, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un ke paas nikle aur farmaya ke kya do Namazein sath, kya do Namazein sath. Aur ye Fajr ki Namaz mein un do rakaton ke bare mein tha jo Fajr se pehle hain."
"285","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Abdullah bin Umar se Fajr ki do rakat foot gain to unhon ne suraj nikalne ke baad un ki qaza ki."
"286","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, unhon ne Qasim bin Muhammad se riwayat kya ke unhon ne waisa hi kya jaisa Ibn Umar ne kya tha."
